00:00:31.057 --> 00:00:34.485
Nothing is uploaded, so your slides never leave your device.

00:00:34.485 --> 00:00:35.742
There is no watermark.

00:00:37.442 --> 00:00:38.930
Try it with your own deck.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:43.050
Head to powerpoint2vid.com and turn your slides into a video in minutes.

